# A minimal well-formed file: one confirmed entry, one reported entry.
quirk   demo-confirmed
match   name=fs version>=40
because A confirmed entry that auto-applies.
action  expect-deviation demo-test 7/0
status  confirmed

quirk   demo-reported
match   name=fs
because A reported entry: inert unless forced by id.
action  downgrade demo-other
status  reported

quirk   demo-skip
match   name=fs kick>=37
because A confirmed skip entry, to prove skip is consulted pre-execution.
action  skip demo-dangerous
status  confirmed
